<template>
  <section class="document-evidence" aria-label="原文证据与条款治理">
    <el-alert v-if="!v.authorized" title="仅当前超级管理员可管理原文证据，请核对登录权限" type="info" :closable="false" />
    <p v-if="v.error" role="alert">{{ v.error }}</p>
    <template v-if="v.authorized">
      <el-alert title="原文与条款人工审核基座" description="来源与版本是提交方声明，不代表官方来源或临床已验证。尚未接入AI自动抽取；批准候选不会自动发布知识。" type="info" :closable="false" />
      <p>仅UTF8 txt、md或直接文字；原文≤4MiB。Unicode codepoint半开区间 [开始,结束)，保留BOM、CRLF、emoji与组合字符。每段知识原UTF8≤65535字节，超限整段拒绝。</p>
      <el-button type="primary" :disabled="v.busy||!v.options" @click="v.openOriginal">登记原文草稿</el-button><el-button :loading="v.loading" @click="v.refresh">刷新原件目录</el-button>
      <p v-if="v.notice" role="status">{{ v.notice }}</p>
      <el-tabs v-model="v.tab" @tab-change="v.changeTab"><el-tab-pane label="原始文档" name="originals" /><el-tab-pane label="条款候选" name="candidates" /><el-tab-pane label="知识发布" name="publications" /></el-tabs>
      <el-table :data="v.directories[v.tab]?.items||[]" :empty-text="v.directories[v.tab]?'尚无登记记录':'尚未读取目录'" :aria-label="'原文证据目录 '+v.tab">
        <el-table-column label="原件" min-width="220"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.title||row.candidate_id||row.publication_id }}</template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="版本与范围" min-width="160"><template #default="{row}">{{ row.version||(v.tab==='candidates'?`[${row.start},${row.end})`:'完整发布链') }}</template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="治理状态" width="130"><template #default="{row}">{{ v.documentEvidenceStates[row.status] }}</template></el-table-column>
        <el-table-column label="操作" width="150"><template #default="{row}"><el-button :disabled="v.busy" @click="v.inspect(v.tab,row)">核对完整原件</el-button></template></el-table-column>
      </el-table>
      <el-pagination v-if="v.directories[v.tab]" :current-page="v.directories[v.tab].page" :page-size="v.directories[v.tab].page_size" :total="v.directories[v.tab].total" layout="prev,pager,next,total" @current-change="page=>v.loadPage(v.tab,page)" />
    </template>
    <el-dialog v-model="v.originalOpen" title="登记不可变UTF8原文" width="820px" destroy-on-close :close-on-click-modal="false">
      <template v-if="v.authorized"><el-form label-position="top">
        <el-form-item v-for="[key,label] in originalFields" :key="key" :label="label"><el-input v-model="v.originalForm[key]" :aria-label="label" :type="key.endsWith('_note')?'textarea':'text'" /></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="文档类型"><el-select v-model="v.originalForm.document_kind" aria-label="文档类型"><el-option v-for="(label,value) in v.documentKinds" :key="value" :label="label" :value="value" /></el-select></el-form-item>
        <el-form-item label="本次输入方法"><el-radio-group v-model="v.inputKind" aria-label="本次输入方法" @change="v.inputChanged"><el-radio value="direct_text">直接文字</el-radio><el-radio value="utf8_file">原UTF8文件</el-radio></el-radio-group></el-form-item>
        <template v-if="v.inputKind==='direct_text'"><p>直接文字按本次提交值登记；需保留原文件换行或BOM时请选择原文件。</p><el-input v-model="v.originalForm.text" aria-label="原文正文" type="textarea" :rows="10" /></template>
        <template v-else><input aria-label="UTF8原文件" type="file" accept=".txt,.md" @change="v.selectFile" /><p>{{ v.fileContent?'已核对原文件字节：'+v.fileContent.filename:'尚未选择完整原文件' }}</p></template>
      </el-form><p v-if="v.formError" role="alert">{{ v.formError }}</p></template>
      <template #footer><el-button @click="v.originalOpen=false">取消登记</el-button><el-button type="primary" :loading="v.busy" :disabled="!v.authorized" @click="v.submitOriginal">核对字节并登记草稿</el-button></template>
    </el-dialog>
    <el-dialog v-model="v.detailOpen" title="完整原文、定位与治理核对" width="960px" destroy-on-close :close-on-click-modal="false">
      <template v-if="v.authorized&&v.detail">
        <p>状态：{{ v.documentEvidenceStates[v.detail.row.governance.status] }} · 治理修订 {{ v.detail.row.governance.revision }} · 临床验证未提供</p>
        <p v-if="!v.detail.row.eligible" role="status">当前不具备下游使用条件：{{ v.detail.row.ineligibility_reasons.map(reason=>reasonLabels[reason]||reason).join('；') }}</p>
        <p>完整内容SHA256：<code>{{ v.detail.row.content_hash }}</code></p>
        <template v-if="v.detail.original"><p>声明标题/版本：{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.metadata.title }} / {{ v.detail.original.snapshot.metadata.version }}</p><p>声明出处：{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.metadata.declared_source_uri }}；仅为提交方声明，不访问外部地址。</p><p>原可得UTC：{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.metadata.source_available_at??'未记录' }}；服务器登记UTC：{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.recorded_at }}</p><p>原UTF8字节 {{ v.detail.original.snapshot.raw_bytes_length }}；Unicode codepoint {{ v.detail.original.snapshot.codepoint_length }}；原字节SHA256：<code>{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.raw_bytes_hash }}</code></p><p>适用范围：{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.metadata.applicability_note }}</p><p>授权说明：{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.metadata.authorization_note }}</p><el-button @click="v.downloadOriginal">下载原UTF8字节</el-button><details><summary>展开完整原文</summary><pre aria-label="完整原文字节对应文本">{{ v.detail.original.snapshot.text }}</pre></details></template>
        <template v-if="v.detail.candidate"><p>候选标题：{{ v.detail.candidate.snapshot.proposal.proposed_heading }}；codepoint区间 [{{ v.detail.candidate.snapshot.proposal.start }},{{ v.detail.candidate.snapshot.proposal.end }})</p><pre aria-label="精确条款引文">{{ v.detail.candidate.snapshot.proposal.quote }}</pre></template>
        <template v-if="v.detail.kind==='publications'"><p>知识标题/版本：{{ v.detail.row.snapshot.knowledge.title }} / {{ v.detail.row.snapshot.knowledge.version }}</p><p>实际发布UTC（保留微秒）：{{ v.detail.row.snapshot.published_at }}；旧知识表登记UTC（整秒存储）：{{ v.detail.row.snapshot.knowledge_recorded_at }}。此精度政策不改变原件与候选时钟。</p><p>真实知识当前状态：{{ knowledgeStates[v.detail.row.knowledge_current.status] }}；已逐字段比对冻结发布件与真实当前知识。</p></template>
